>
>
>
> I checked the resulting configure file and the part in question looks like:
>
>
> echo "configure.ac: starting"
>
>  as_dir=./ ;;
>     */) ;;
>     *) as_dir=$as_dir/ ;;
>   esac
>     for ac_exec_ext in '' $ac_executable_extensions; do
